<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>There is a peace within me</l><l>That has sprung from deep contentment</l><l>With my Lord, who’s All in All.</l><l>For my delight is in this</l><l>Living One inside of me</l><l>Who is Himself, my everything.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
